# EXAMPLE ONLY. This file ends in .disabled so it can never be registered by
# accident. Rename it to p004_openrouter.yaml and run it explicitly to use it.
name: p004_openrouter_example
template_path: templates/elicitor.md
members:
  - provider: claude_cli
    model: haiku
    k_repeats: 5
  - provider: openrouter
    model: anthropic/claude-haiku-4.5
    k_repeats: 5
  - provider: openrouter
    model: openai/gpt-6-luna
    k_repeats: 5
  - provider: openrouter
    model: google/gemini-3.8-flash
    k_repeats: 5
  - provider: openrouter
    model: x-ai/grok-4.7
    k_repeats: 5
notes: >
  Example four-provider ensemble (claude CLI plus four OpenRouter members).
  The OpenRouter model ids were taken from openrouter.ai model pages on
  2026-09-28 and must be re-checked against
  https://openrouter.ai/api/v1/models before use. No OpenRouter call is made
  unless this file is renamed to .yaml and run explicitly.
